WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.297
FIFTY DOORS.
THREE STATES.
ONE STANDARD.

00:00:03.297 --> 00:00:05.271
MICHIGAN

00:00:05.271 --> 00:00:07.918
OHIO.

00:00:07.918 --> 00:00:09.892
INDIANA.

00:00:09.892 --> 00:00:13.839
A TREE WENT
THROUGH THE ROOF.

00:00:13.839 --> 00:00:17.810
REBUILT.
RE-RENTED.

00:00:17.810 --> 00:00:21.757
A HOME AGAIN.

00:00:21.757 --> 00:00:27.028
A BANK MANAGER
WATCHED IT ALL.

00:00:28.352 --> 00:00:30.999
THEN ASKED US
TO BUY HER HOUSE.

00:00:30.999 --> 00:00:34.946
ONE BUYER.
THE WHOLE SET.

00:00:34.946 --> 00:00:38.243
OWN. OPERATE. REPEAT.

00:00:38.243 --> 00:00:43.514
MADE IN AMERICA,
LOCAL TO THE MIDWEST.

00:00:43.514 --> 00:00:50.759
BUILDING COMMUNITIES,
LOCALLY.
